id=encore-transsion
name=Encore Tweaks (Transsion)
version=
versionCode=
author=drybrine, Rem01Gaming
description=Encore Tweaks for Infinix / Tecno / itel (Transsion XOS). Same tweaks as upstream, plus a fix for the one thing that defeated them on these devices: com.transsion.usf caps the CPU clusters from a virtual skin temperature, so Encore's clock tweaks were being clamped underneath it. This build removes only that CPU cap.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/drybrine/encore-transsion/main/update.json
banner=banner.webp
webuiIcon=webroot/icon.webp
